What are Share Registry Services?

Share Registry Services are specialized administrative functions essential for the accurate maintenance of a company's shareholder register. These services form the critical backbone of corporate governance, encompassing everything from processing dividend payments and managing complex corporate actions like mergers and stock splits to facilitating comprehensive shareholder communication. They serve as a vital compliance tool, ensuring publicly traded entities adhere to a complex web of securities regulations across different jurisdictions.

